        {
          "name": "Show Option Dialog",
          "type": "Bool"
        },
        {
          "name": "Full Path",
          "type": "String&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Out Operation Canceled",
          "type": "Bool&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Out Export All",
          "type": "Bool&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Load the export option from the last save state and show the dialog if bShowOptionDialog is true.\nFullPath is the export file path we display in the dialog.\nIf the user cancels the dialog, the OutOperationCanceled will be true.\nbOutExportAll will be true if the user wants to use the same option for all other assets they want to export.\nThe function is saving the dialog state in a user ini file and reload it from there. It is not changing the CDO."
    },
